  "reason": "The 3.5x PAT spike vs FY22-FY21 average is distorted by FY21 loss (-₹0.13 cr). FY23 PAT grew 36% YoY (₹0.58→₹0.79 cr) alongside revenue doubling (₹2.47→₹5.23 cr), reflecting the trading business's scale-up (rhp:p95). The P&L (rhp:p42,133) shows revenue growth from ₹0.09 cr (FY21) to ₹2.47 cr (FY22) to ₹5.23 cr (FY23). Four-month FY24 revenue of ₹17.19 cr (rhp:p163) confirms trajectory. No one-off items; growth is organic.",
